@api = http://localhost:5142

### Log in (copy accessToken from the response into @token below)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo", "password": "FocusFlow123!" }

###
@token = paste-token-here

### List tasks: page 1, 5 per page, only pending
GET {{api}}/api/tasks?page=1&pageSize=5&status=Pending

### Dashboard counts
GET {{api}}/api/tasks/summary

### Create a task (needs the token)
POST {{api}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Try the API", "description": "From the .http file", "dueDate": "2030-01-01", "status": "Pending" }

### Without a token this returns 401
DELETE {{api}}/api/tasks/1
